  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The GitHub actions workflow “Build Main Branch” seems to build Docker images in the deploy job, but never pushes them to Docker Hub.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The last execution of the workflow from ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "timestamp": "1775606400000"
       },
       "type": "date"
      },
      {
       "text": " (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/actions/runs/24147566494/job/70470612272"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": ") shows the following warning in the step “Deploy Docker Image”:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "text"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "WARNING: No output specified with docker-container driver. Build result will only remain in the build cache. To push result image into registry use --push or to load image into docker use --load",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Analysis: The script ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/main/build-and-push-to-dockerhub.sh"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "build-and-push-to-dockerhub.sh from fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " used to build the Docker image, only pushes the Image to Docker Hub, when the command line flag ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "--push",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " as been specified. This flag is currently missing in the workflow.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
