     "body": "<p>Currently in fcrepo-docker, the actions workflow <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/main/.github/workflows/rebuild-latest-stable-image.yml\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">\"Rebuild latest release image version\"</a> does also not push the Image to Docker Hub at the end:</p>",
